[edit]I realized this may have sounded official... it&#39;s really not... I am just playing with this myself and hoping for some feedback![/edit]

&nbsp;

I&#39;ve thrown together a kind of basic update - it feels similar to the original Story Challenges in that there are 2 per environment, nemesis challenges, some special challenges, etc...

&nbsp;

I removed two that bothered me... namely, the ones for cumulative damage and healing - those generally end up with people saying &quot;meh, I&#39;ve done 500 damage over all my games by now...&quot; &nbsp;Concepts were fine, but they were just hard to track.

&nbsp;

Updated Challenges:
<ul><li>Heroic Dedication (more points, all heroes listed)</li><li>Catfight (renamed &quot;Massive Catfight&quot;, now includes all female villains, worth more points)</li><li>Stop, Evildoer!&nbsp; (more points, all villains listed) </li><li>Universal Guardian (more points, all villains listed)</li><li>World Traveler (more points, all environments listed)</li></ul>
&nbsp;

New Challenges:
<ul><li>In the Name of Freedom... Two! (15SP) - &nbsp;Win a game as the Freedom 6</li><li>A Virus Among Us &nbsp;(40SP) - Defeat Plague Rat while all heroes are infected </li><li>Safe &nbsp;(50SP) - While fighting Spite do not allow any innocents to die </li><li> Operation Chairman (30SP) - Defeat The Chairman while The Operative is still in play, then win the game </li><li> Birds of a Feather (30SP) - Defeat the Matriarch with The Mask in play </li><li> The Tormented Earth (20SP) - Deal over 125 damage to Akash&#39;Bhuta directly in one game. </li><li> Of Gods and Men (30SP) - Defeat all 9 members of The Ennead in one round </li><li> Fists of Fury (20SP) - Defeat Apostate with both Gauntlets of Perdition in play (I just realized I don&#39;t think this is possible and should be replaced) </li><li> A Walking Arsenal (25SP) - Defeat Ambuscade with 5 different devices in play </li><li> Beats, Books, and Bones (60SP) - Defeat GLoomweaver with all three of his Relics in play </li><li> Luck Smiles on the Unlucky (30SP) - Defeat Kismet without destroying any Jinx cards </li><li> Across a Sea of Time (35SP) - The heroes must win and may not destroy La Paradoja Magnifica while fighting La Capitan </li><li> All in your Head (45SP) - Defeat The Dreamer with all heroes and The Dreamer at full health </li><li> Get a Clue (15SP) - Miss Information must play a clue on a hero turn </li><li> America&#39;s Fallen Legacy (50SP) - Stop Iron Legacy before he deals more than 32 damage </li><li>A Mother&#39;s Contempt (10SP) - Defeat Citizen Dawn as Expatriette</li><li>Mirror Images (10SP) - Defeat Omnitron as Omnitron-X</li><li>You Give That Back! (10SP) - Defeat Plague Rat as the Chrono Ranger</li><li>Love Lost, Avenged (10SP) - Defeat Spite as The Wraith</li><li>Our Town (10SP) - Defeat The Chairman as Mr. Fixer</li><li>Fletching (10SP) - Defeat The Matriarch as Tachyon</li><li>Harmony with Nature (10SP) - Defeat Akash&#39;Bhuta as The Argent Adept</li><li>Black and White and Red All Over (10SP) - Defeat Apostate as The Fanatic</li><li>I Attack the Darkness (10SP) - Defeat Gloomweaver as Nightmist</li><li>Greet the Sun (10SP) - Defeat The Ennead as Ra</li><li>Pants of Fury (10SP) - Defeat Ambuscade as Haka</li><li>Lost Legacies (10SP) - Defeat Iron Legacy as The Freedom Six</li><li>Malkovich, Malkovich, Malkovich (10SP) - Defeat The Dreamer as The Visionary</li><li>The Ratpack (20SP) - Win the game with 4 Escaped Lab Rats in play</li><li>Dangerous Chemicals (50SP) - Do not destroy any chemical vats while battling in the Pike Industrial Complex.</li><li>Help Wanted (20SP) - Do not allow Dr. Tremata or Tony Taurus to be killed while fighting in Rook City</li><li>The Streets Will Run... Green? (40SP) - Allow Toxic Sludge to kill the villain with at least one surviving hero.</li><li>... When You&#39;re Having Fun (20SP) - Play at least H*4 cards between all heroes in one turn while Time Flies is in play.</li><li>From Another Dimension (40SP) - Allow a Portal Fiend to kill the villain</li><li>Tribulations (15SP) - Win the game with at least 3 Trial cards in play.</li><li>The Fall of Anubis (25SP) - Defeat Anubis with only hero damage.</li><li>Breaking Point (75SP) - Reduce all targets to 0 health with fixed point in play, then win the game. &nbsp;(You read that right. &nbsp;All targets.)</li><li>Crushing... Victory? (40SP) - Allow the Crushing Hallway to defeat the Villain. &nbsp;All heroes must survive</li><li>Barely Hanging On (25SP) - Win the game with 1 card left in the environment trash and the card &quot;Lost in the Past&quot; in play</li><li>Let the Sheriff Get His Men (35SP) - Let Sheriff Pratt kill all three Hayes Brothers in one game.</li><li>The Hoeff is Mine! (30SP) - Allow Char to kill Warden Hoefle.</li><li>Excessive Defense (20SP) - Win the game with Defensive Displacement in play.</li><li>Wasted (40SP) - Allow at least 5 Cryptids to be removed from the game with Unforgiving Wasteland in play</li><li>Con&#39;s Full House (35SP) - Accumulate 3 Rat Beasts and 2 other matching Cryptids with Con&#39;s Bunker in play.</li><li>Devastation (50SP) - Deal 50 or more damage in a single Hero Turn.</li></ul>
&nbsp;

I think that&#39;s all of them...


